## Why This Is Asked
Explores per-tenant explainability routing, privacy controls, and latency budgets in a beginner-friendly way.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant policy: explainEnabled, modelVariant, maxRationaleLength
- Request routing: explainability path vs standard path
- Latency constraints: p95 target, caching, streaming where possible
- Privacy: strip PII from explanations

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo routing sketch
function decide(tenant, prompt){
  if (policy[tenant].explainEnabled){
    return routeExplain(prompt, tenant);
  }
  return routeNormal(prompt, tenant);
}
```

